WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 6=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.587
(The Emperor Visits
Wei the Fool in Prison)

00:42.975 --> 00:43.850
(Juxian Restaurant Seizure List)

00:43.875 --> 00:44.674
Your Majesty,

00:45.035 --> 00:46.274
the shop has been seized.

00:46.274 --> 00:47.914
All items have also been sealed.

00:48.275 --> 00:49.594
Furthermore, I suspect

00:49.594 --> 00:51.715
that the boss is in league
with Beicang merchants.

00:51.875 --> 00:52.754
Beicang?

00:56.594 --> 00:58.075
What happened to your face?

00:59.155 --> 00:59.674
Well...

01:00.635 --> 01:01.514
Your Majesty,

01:01.795 --> 01:04.074
I got into a fight with the boss.

01:04.354 --> 01:05.635
The brat is strong.

01:05.834 --> 01:07.234
He injured several of us.

01:07.674 --> 01:08.475
Presumptuous.

01:09.074 --> 01:10.674
He dared to fight the Imperial Guards?

01:11.874 --> 01:14.234
Let the Ministry of Justice
teach this brat a lesson.

01:14.234 --> 01:14.714
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:15.595 --> 01:16.235
Get in there.

01:18.835 --> 01:19.915
I'm telling you...

01:21.394 --> 01:22.835
Why are you locking me up?

01:22.835 --> 01:23.674
I'm just a merchant.

01:23.674 --> 01:25.235
I have nothing to do with him.

01:26.235 --> 01:27.635
How do you look like a merchant?

01:28.315 --> 01:29.754
And you look like a merchant?

01:30.354 --> 01:32.394
Daring to fight Commander Cheng Chuchi,

01:32.595 --> 01:33.875
I think you've lived long enough.

01:34.315 --> 01:35.235
Cheng Chuchi?

01:35.595 --> 01:36.394
Who's that?

01:36.595 --> 01:37.875
That's the son of the Duke,

01:37.875 --> 01:39.394
Cheng Sanfu's son.

01:40.754 --> 01:41.794
Cheng Sanfu?

01:42.595 --> 01:43.754
The Duke's son?

01:44.100 --> 01:46.712
(Ganlu Palace)

01:47.234 --> 01:48.434
(I finally found a way)

01:48.434 --> 01:50.074
(to make money for
the imperial treasury.)

01:50.434 --> 01:51.714
(It had only just begun,)

01:52.154 --> 01:53.314
(and it was shut down.)

01:54.594 --> 01:56.395
(And the one who
shut it down wasn't just anyone,)

01:56.755 --> 01:58.115
(it was Father.)

01:58.115 --> 01:59.362
(Ganlu Palace)

01:59.395 --> 02:00.195
Your Highness,

02:02.635 --> 02:03.555
what's the matter?

02:06.195 --> 02:07.275
Eunuch Wang,

02:07.835 --> 02:09.714
is Father not out of court yet?

02:09.835 --> 02:10.835
He is.

02:11.115 --> 02:13.475
He was just asking about Your Highness.

02:18.212 --> 02:21.550
(Ganlu Palace)

02:28.954 --> 02:29.755
Your Highness,

02:29.794 --> 02:30.915
what's happened to you?

02:36.050 --> 02:38.162
(Ganlu Palace)

02:44.635 --> 02:46.434
Who is that crying outside?

02:46.434 --> 02:47.475
Reporting to Your Majesty,

02:47.514 --> 02:47.835
it is

02:47.954 --> 02:49.874
Her Highness, the Eldest Princess.

02:50.874 --> 02:52.474
Who dares bully my daughter?

02:53.154 --> 02:53.995
My daughter...

02:55.154 --> 02:56.075
My daughter, come.

02:56.194 --> 02:57.154
Tell me,

02:57.874 --> 02:58.874
who bullied you?

02:59.275 --> 03:00.075
You.

03:01.314 --> 03:01.995
Who?

03:02.075 --> 03:02.995
You.

03:05.634 --> 03:06.474
This...

03:06.795 --> 03:08.714
You've got me all confused.

03:10.914 --> 03:11.634
My daughter,

03:11.795 --> 03:13.194
those Beicang gemstones

03:14.235 --> 03:15.555
are everywhere in the Great Yong,

03:15.675 --> 03:17.314
just as you said.

03:17.675 --> 03:19.355
How did you know?

03:20.275 --> 03:21.675
You have the nerve to bring that up.

03:21.914 --> 03:23.714
Why did you seal my shop?

03:23.714 --> 03:25.515
That's a shop
that could make so much money.

03:27.194 --> 03:30.075
I wouldn't seal a shop.

03:30.434 --> 03:31.154
Besides,

03:31.154 --> 03:33.955
sealing a shop doesn't
require me to be there.

03:34.275 --> 03:35.594
It was you who sealed it.

03:35.594 --> 03:37.034
The Imperial Guards are still there.

03:37.034 --> 03:37.995
Impossible.

03:38.515 --> 03:39.235
Someone, come.

03:39.914 --> 03:40.714
Go investigate.

03:42.115 --> 03:42.914
Your Majesty.

03:43.835 --> 03:44.555
Your Majesty.

03:45.075 --> 03:45.795
What is it?

03:45.914 --> 03:46.914
Today, the Imperial Guards

03:47.075 --> 03:49.594
did indeed receive
orders to seal a shop.

03:57.955 --> 03:59.075
Well...

03:59.314 --> 03:59.795
The...

03:59.795 --> 04:01.434
The shop selling gemstones?

04:05.754 --> 04:06.634
My daughter,

04:06.634 --> 04:08.194
don't cry.

04:08.194 --> 04:09.075
My dear daughter.

04:11.474 --> 04:12.115
My daughter,

04:12.795 --> 04:14.395
tell me clearly,

04:14.995 --> 04:15.795
why

04:15.795 --> 04:17.754
would the shop be yours?

04:18.395 --> 04:19.474
I put money into it,

04:19.555 --> 04:20.714
so it's mine.

04:20.754 --> 04:22.395
Why did you seal the shop?

04:22.395 --> 04:24.275
And you even threw Wei Hao in prison.

04:24.515 --> 04:25.874
Who is Wei Hao?

04:25.874 --> 04:27.194
That sounds familiar.

04:27.474 --> 04:29.395
I was going to report to you,

04:30.474 --> 04:32.275
and I didn't even attend
the opening ceremony.

04:33.555 --> 04:34.555
Who would have thought

04:34.555 --> 04:35.955
that after only half a day,

04:36.235 --> 04:37.754
it would be sealed by you?

04:38.634 --> 04:39.555
My daughter,

04:39.874 --> 04:41.235
it's all my fault.

04:41.474 --> 04:43.154
Tell me everything.

04:43.355 --> 04:44.634
What exactly happened?

04:53.314 --> 04:53.835
Duo Xiang.

04:56.634 --> 04:57.914
What are you doing?

04:58.314 --> 04:59.715
Did you send the Imperial Guards there?

05:00.314 --> 05:01.915
You wanted to ruin my business, right?

05:01.915 --> 05:02.995
Are you insane?

05:03.035 --> 05:04.394
What good does
ruining your business do me?

05:04.394 --> 05:05.874
Then, you must be a Beicang spy.

05:06.035 --> 05:06.475
Me?

05:08.035 --> 05:08.834
You're the spy.

05:08.834 --> 05:09.995
Your whole family are spies.

05:11.434 --> 05:13.035
Then, why is your
Central Plains dialect so good?

05:13.074 --> 05:13.715
I...

05:14.115 --> 05:14.795
See?

05:14.995 --> 05:16.675
You Beicang spy, stop trying to fake it.

05:17.074 --> 05:17.874
Officer,

05:17.954 --> 05:19.675
I found a Beicang spy!

05:19.675 --> 05:20.475
Come quickly. She...

05:20.475 --> 05:22.434
My parents were both
killed by the Beicang people.

05:22.555 --> 05:24.194
How could I possibly work for them?

05:29.475 --> 05:30.995
Even though my home is in Beicang,

05:31.514 --> 05:32.874
my parents were killed by rebels

05:32.874 --> 05:34.314
who were after our family property.

05:34.514 --> 05:35.675
That's why they...

05:40.074 --> 05:41.675
My family really just did business.

05:41.675 --> 05:43.434
We never bullied anyone.

05:43.434 --> 05:44.115
You

05:44.115 --> 05:45.274
calm down.

05:45.514 --> 05:46.314
Calm down?

05:46.795 --> 05:48.874
I'm just a woman with
no power to take revenge.

05:49.155 --> 05:50.915
I could only focus on
mastering the ways of business.

05:51.634 --> 05:53.874
All these years,
I've traveled far and wide,

05:54.115 --> 05:55.155
crossing deserts,

05:55.155 --> 05:55.874
traversing grasslands,

05:55.874 --> 05:56.675
climbing snow mountains,

05:56.675 --> 05:57.634
and crossing rivers.

05:57.715 --> 05:59.355
I did it all to earn back all the money

05:59.355 --> 06:00.274
in Beicang,

06:00.274 --> 06:02.235
to make sure
that my parents didn't die in vain.

06:03.915 --> 06:04.874
But now, you...

06:05.475 --> 06:07.995
You can actually make
gemstones out of sand,

06:07.995 --> 06:09.115
and glaze too.

06:11.194 --> 06:13.155
How am I supposed to make any money now?

06:13.634 --> 06:15.595
I've been dragged
into this cell because of you.

06:15.754 --> 06:18.754
How will I ever be able
to avenge my parents?

06:22.795 --> 06:23.595
You...

06:24.274 --> 06:25.555
Why are you crying?

06:26.634 --> 06:27.715
Stop crying.

06:28.274 --> 06:29.475
I have connections.

06:29.795 --> 06:31.155
Someone will get us out in a bit.

06:32.634 --> 06:33.595
You're lying!

06:33.595 --> 06:34.434
I'm serious.

06:34.434 --> 06:35.314
I'm not lying to you.

06:39.035 --> 06:39.834
Really?

06:39.874 --> 06:40.954
Real as a gemstone.

06:42.194 --> 06:42.715
No,

06:42.874 --> 06:44.715
well, just trust me.

06:44.954 --> 06:45.754
Get some rest.

06:46.715 --> 06:47.475
It won't be long

06:47.475 --> 06:48.595
before I get you out.

07:01.675 --> 07:02.834
It's so profitable?

07:04.115 --> 07:05.995
I didn't believe it at first either.

07:06.035 --> 07:06.675
Luckily,

07:06.675 --> 07:08.595
he gave me a 50 percent share.

07:08.915 --> 07:10.514
For this year's imperial treasury,

07:10.754 --> 07:12.115
it should be enough.

07:14.715 --> 07:15.715
This business

07:15.715 --> 07:17.394
also prevented the Beicang people

07:17.394 --> 07:19.035
from gaining 100,000 guan from us.

07:22.675 --> 07:23.235
Oh, no.

07:23.795 --> 07:25.074
Wei Hao is still in prison.

07:25.074 --> 07:25.675
My daughter,

07:27.074 --> 07:28.834
I'll just have him released.

07:29.874 --> 07:30.675
Father,

07:30.675 --> 07:32.155
let me go get him.

07:32.915 --> 07:33.715
Why?

07:33.995 --> 07:34.915
You don't know.

07:35.634 --> 07:36.795
The fool

07:36.795 --> 07:38.355
has a temper as stubborn as a mule's.

07:39.314 --> 07:41.155
I promised him before

07:41.475 --> 07:43.514
that I would protect him.

07:43.834 --> 07:45.555
Now that he's ended up in prison,

07:45.915 --> 07:47.355
I'm afraid he'll get stubborn

07:47.355 --> 07:48.795
and refuse to do it anymore.

07:49.754 --> 07:51.394
So only he knows

07:51.634 --> 07:52.675
the method for making gemstones?

07:53.795 --> 07:55.115
I didn't take part.

07:55.235 --> 07:56.514
Only he knows.

07:58.394 --> 07:59.314
Well, I'll go too.

07:59.795 --> 08:00.995
I want to see what Wei the Fool

08:01.715 --> 08:02.874
is actually capable of.

08:02.874 --> 08:03.434
Father,

08:03.954 --> 08:05.274
you'd better not go.

08:05.834 --> 08:07.514
He's full of nonsense.

08:07.675 --> 08:09.795
I'm afraid his foolishness
might offend you.

08:11.834 --> 08:13.954
As the Emperor of the Great Yong,

08:13.954 --> 08:15.995
could I not even tolerate one fool?

08:16.235 --> 08:16.915
Daughter,

08:17.235 --> 08:18.954
you underestimate me.

08:20.314 --> 08:20.995
Then,

08:21.834 --> 08:23.155
you should go in disguise.

08:23.475 --> 08:24.035
This...

08:25.834 --> 08:26.355
Fine.

08:26.555 --> 08:27.834
I'll put on a disguise

08:28.115 --> 08:29.355
and go over there with you.

08:29.915 --> 08:31.035
What are you doing? Move it.

08:31.434 --> 08:32.915
Hurry up and move the stuff inside.

08:33.394 --> 08:34.035
Be careful.

08:34.035 --> 08:34.634
Young Madam.

08:34.874 --> 08:35.355
Young Madam.

08:35.595 --> 08:36.155
Young Madam,

08:36.434 --> 08:38.115
Young Master was taken to
the Ministry of Justice prison.

08:40.035 --> 08:40.834
What?

08:41.715 --> 08:42.754
What happened?

08:42.754 --> 08:43.795
Don't panic, Young Madam.

08:43.954 --> 08:45.795
Young Master sent word through someone.

08:45.834 --> 08:47.514
He said not to worry.

08:48.995 --> 08:51.235
How can he be fine in
the Ministry of Justice prison?

08:51.355 --> 08:52.434
That is a place where

08:52.434 --> 08:53.675
no one ever comes out once they go in.

08:54.834 --> 08:56.475
Could he have offended the Princess?

08:57.314 --> 08:57.874
No.

08:58.035 --> 08:59.155
I have to go find Hao.

08:59.874 --> 09:00.675
Young Madam.

09:02.915 --> 09:03.434
So...

09:04.155 --> 09:04.954
What's wrong with Young Master?

09:05.394 --> 09:05.675
I hope

09:05.954 --> 09:07.155
nothing bad happens.

09:08.555 --> 09:09.555
What exactly is going on?

09:09.954 --> 09:11.194
Wei the Fool

09:11.475 --> 09:13.995
actually dared to forge
gemstones for private profit.

09:20.674 --> 09:21.874
You're dead meat.

09:25.825 --> 09:27.387
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

09:27.715 --> 09:29.475
I have two fours.

09:29.674 --> 09:30.475
Two eights.

09:30.914 --> 09:31.914
This is fun.

09:31.914 --> 09:32.874
Way more fun than dice.

09:32.874 --> 09:33.075
Yeah.

09:33.075 --> 09:33.754
Two circles.

09:33.754 --> 09:34.554
How did you come up with this?

09:34.715 --> 09:35.435
This is nothing.

09:36.435 --> 09:38.195
What are your
measly wages even good for?

09:38.315 --> 09:39.195
Stick with me from now on,

09:39.274 --> 09:40.754
and I'll make sure
you're living the high life.

09:41.115 --> 09:42.154
You fool

09:42.154 --> 09:43.195
actually know how to make money?

09:43.554 --> 09:45.274
Those are two different things, okay?

09:45.514 --> 09:46.754
I'm usually a fool,

09:47.034 --> 09:48.435
but when it comes to making money,

09:48.435 --> 09:49.835
my mind is as sharp as a tack.

09:51.195 --> 09:52.394
You know Juxian Restaurant?

09:52.835 --> 09:54.274
I started it.

09:54.674 --> 09:55.554
Business is good, right?

09:55.995 --> 09:57.554
I heard it's expensive.

09:57.715 --> 09:59.115
I've never been there.

09:59.634 --> 10:00.435
In a bit,

10:00.435 --> 10:01.514
I'll write a note for you guys.

10:02.274 --> 10:03.115
All of you go eat there.

10:03.115 --> 10:03.914
It's on the house.

10:03.995 --> 10:04.514
My treat.

10:04.715 --> 10:06.075
- Thank you, Young Master Wei.
- Thank you, Young Master Wei.

10:07.394 --> 10:08.115
Let's go...

10:15.595 --> 10:16.794
You brat,

10:16.874 --> 10:17.955
so you finally showed up, huh?

10:18.355 --> 10:19.195
I...

10:19.634 --> 10:19.874
I...

10:19.874 --> 10:20.435
Fine.

10:20.835 --> 10:21.794
I won't hold it against you.

10:22.475 --> 10:22.995
Girl,

10:23.274 --> 10:24.274
this time we're in trouble.

10:24.514 --> 10:25.835
I beat up Cheng Sanfu's son,

10:25.835 --> 10:26.955
Cheng Chuchi.

10:27.034 --> 10:27.995
Can you fix this for me?

10:29.514 --> 10:30.315
It's fine.

10:30.595 --> 10:32.195
Commander Cheng won't hold a grudge.

10:32.355 --> 10:33.514
You said it.

10:33.835 --> 10:34.835
If they come for revenge later,

10:34.835 --> 10:35.874
you have to look out for me.

10:36.435 --> 10:37.235
Also,

10:37.355 --> 10:38.514
didn't I tell you?

10:38.514 --> 10:40.034
I could have it done in five days.

10:40.274 --> 10:41.955
As one of the bosses,
you still didn't show.

10:42.274 --> 10:43.595
Are you trying to
make me mad on purpose?

10:44.075 --> 10:46.955
(This guy really does look like a fool.)

10:47.115 --> 10:47.595
I...

10:48.115 --> 10:49.634
I am busy with affairs.

10:49.914 --> 10:51.075
I'm not like you,

10:51.075 --> 10:52.034
only knowing how to play around.

10:52.595 --> 10:53.995
When did I play around?

10:54.154 --> 10:54.955
I told you,

10:54.955 --> 10:57.115
people would surely covet that glass.

10:57.315 --> 10:57.835
No, wait.

10:58.235 --> 10:59.355
What's up with your father?

10:59.355 --> 11:00.674
Why did he shut down my shop?

11:00.874 --> 11:02.914
We're just selling glass,
and your father wants in on it?

11:02.914 --> 11:03.754
You...

11:10.537 --> 11:13.367
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:13.987 --> 11:17.387
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:18.157 --> 11:21.107
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:21.447 --> 11:24.147
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:25.747 --> 11:29.217
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:29.217 --> 11:31.447
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:31.447 --> 11:33.557
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:33.557 --> 11:35.577
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:35.577 --> 11:39.937
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:41.377 --> 11:45.107
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:45.377 --> 11:48.977
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:49.137 --> 11:51.217
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:51.217 --> 11:56.007
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:56.227 --> 11:57.847
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:57.847 --> 12:00.187
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:00.257 --> 12:01.447
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:01.447 --> 12:03.847
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:04.057 --> 12:05.777
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:05.777 --> 12:07.757
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:07.927 --> 12:09.677
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:09.677 --> 12:11.777
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:11.777 --> 12:13.247
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:13.247 --> 12:15.477
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:15.697 --> 12:16.897
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:16.897 --> 12:19.417
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:19.547 --> 12:21.257
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:21.257 --> 12:22.537
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:22.687 --> 12:24.107
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:24.107 --> 12:25.147
♪To stay by your side♪

12:25.147 --> 12:27.067
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:27.237 --> 12:30.487
♪We are free and happy♪

12:34.487 --> 12:36.267
♪From a nobody♪

12:36.267 --> 12:38.167
♪To someone now famous♪

12:38.277 --> 12:39.707
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:39.707 --> 12:42.217
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

12:42.317 --> 12:43.897
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:43.897 --> 12:45.967
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:46.177 --> 12:47.857
♪In this vast world♪

12:47.857 --> 12:49.857
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:50.007 --> 12:52.217
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:52.217 --> 12:53.807
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:53.897 --> 12:55.397
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:55.397 --> 12:57.797
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:57.797 --> 12:59.507
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:59.507 --> 13:00.667
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:00.667 --> 13:02.297
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:02.297 --> 13:03.337
♪All I want now♪

13:03.337 --> 13:05.437
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:05.437 --> 13:08.697
♪Year after year♪
